Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":77,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1917487,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":288678,"Name":"LM2017","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1490551048,"LastPoster":{"Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1917487,"PostDate":1490551048,"PostContent":"Hello, My future husband (!) and I are researching all-inclusive resorts in Mexico. We're between...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seanhseymour@gmail.com","IpAddress":"143.115.159.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1490550660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LM2017","Id":288678,"Name":"LM2017","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.69.55.185","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81005,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b0951c88c291aadacbe651ec64d43d3","RawContent":"Hello,\n\n\nMy future husband (!) and I are researching all-inclusive resorts in Mexico. We&#039;re between Moon Palace, Dreams Tulum, and similar resorts....our question is really through negotiation. How much wiggle room is there when negotiating with a resort? Is the price THE price? We&#039;re trying to keep our wedding under a certain price but the numbers add up quickly!","Attachments":[],"Id":1917487,"PostDate":1490551048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello,<br><br>\nMy future husband (!) and I are researching all-inclusive resorts in Mexico. We're between Moon Palace, Dreams Tulum, and similar resorts....our question is really through negotiation. How much wiggle room is there when negotiating with a resort? Is the price THE price? We're trying to keep our wedding under a certain price but the numbers add up quickly!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seanhseymour@gmail.com","IpAddress":"143.115.159.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1490550660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LM2017","Id":288678,"Name":"LM2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81005,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1b2da764c223227b34474c8d3640554","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi LM2017,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TA Wendy here!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations on deciding to have your wedding in Cancun\/Riviera Maya.. it is a great choice and you are correct that there are so many wonderful resorts to choose from.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;With regards to pricing for groups, the resorts set their group rates normally 1-2 years into the future, and the pricing does not need to be negotiated or bargained on.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The thing that will vary and can result in you as bride and groom receiving more in the way if amenities is the size of your group. The more rooms you wind up booking with your group the more you stand to earn in the way of complimentary nights, upgrades, free events and other amenities that your selected resort may offer.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At Wright Travel, we do a great deal of business with the resorts in the area, and are experts and can often get you even more in the way of amenities such as spa certificates, or Bride and Groom fly free promotion, and we are here to advise and assist as you go through the process.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moon Palace and Dreams Tulum are both wonderful resorts in the area, but really could not be any more different one from the other...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We would be glad to chat, and answer all your questions about the process and help you to find your perfect resort!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let us know when you might like to discuss and we will be glad to help!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TA Wendy\t&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;wendy@wrighttravelagency.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HERE.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awards and recognition: &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;AMResorts Master Agent &amp;amp; Top Agency&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent &amp;amp; Top Agency | &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917500,"PostDate":1490889016,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi LM2017,<\/p>\n<p>TA Wendy here!<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations on deciding to have your wedding in Cancun\/Riviera Maya.. it is a great choice and you are correct that there are so many wonderful resorts to choose from.<\/p>\n<p>With regards to pricing for groups, the resorts set their group rates normally 1-2 years into the future, and the pricing does not need to be negotiated or bargained on.<\/p>\n<p>The thing that will vary and can result in you as bride and groom receiving more in the way if amenities is the size of your group. The more rooms you wind up booking with your group the more you stand to earn in the way of complimentary nights, upgrades, free events and other amenities that your selected resort may offer.<\/p>\n<p>At Wright Travel, we do a great deal of business with the resorts in the area, and are experts and can often get you even more in the way of amenities such as spa certificates, or Bride and Groom fly free promotion, and we are here to advise and assist as you go through the process.<\/p>\n<p>Moon Palace and Dreams Tulum are both wonderful resorts in the area, but really could not be any more different one from the other...<\/p>\n<p>We would be glad to chat, and answer all your questions about the process and help you to find your perfect resort!<\/p>\n<p>Let us know when you might like to discuss and we will be glad to help!<\/p>\n<p>TA Wendy\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>wendy@wrighttravelagency.com<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><strong>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><strong>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238034240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"81005","Title":"Budgeting Your Wedding","LastPostDate":1490889016},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
