pg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Jessica_Brennan_Teaser_03.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915523]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-34595000-1472680284.jpg\" title=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_01.jpg - Size: 123.72KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-34595000-1472680284.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_01.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915523]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-95602900-1472680293.jpg\" title=\"Heather_Josue_Teaser_07.jpg - Size: 50.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-95602900-1472680293.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Heather_Josue_Teaser_07.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' 